------- FILE thursdays-child-chapter-one.asm LEVEL 1 PASS 2
      1  7ffa					      processor	6502
      2  8000 ????
      3  8000 ????						; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
      4  8000 ????						; FLOATING IN A MOST PECULIAR WAY
      5  8000 ????						; THURSDAY'S CHILD — CHAPTER ONE INTEGRATED VERTICAL SLICE
      6  8000 ????						;
      7  8000 ????						; This is not a revision of the legacy gradient project.  It is an independent
      8  8000 ????						; 32K F4 production branch with the approved gravity engine in Bank 0, the
      9  8000 ????						; approved black-space renderer in fixed Bank 7, four additional independent
     10  8000 ????						; room banks in Banks 6-3, and Banks 1-2 reserved for later chapter systems.
     11  8000 ????						;
     12  8000 ????						; Proof commitments:
     13  8000 ????						;   * black background and stationary amethyst-gradient terrain
     14  8000 ????						;   * a compact one-player Major Tom with an enclosed black visor opening
     15  8000 ????						;   * one locked neutral astronaut pose; animation budget belongs to objects
     16  8000 ????						;   * terrain collision, side reflection, ceiling reflection and moon bounce
     17  8000 ????						;   * independently authored left/right terrain, with no mirrored-stage rule
     18  8000 ????						;   * three real P1 satellite-dish sprites at unrelated X/Y coordinates
     19  8000 ????						;   * seven carefully authored logical rows doubled into a stable 8x14 suit
     20  8000 ????						;   * only the ready dish emits a slow blue pulse; collectibles shimmer faster
     21  8000 ????						;   * three circular capture tiers and tangent release
     22  8000 ????						;   * a full-height extraction gate revealed by the three required objects
     23  8000 ????						;   * five ordered Chapter One stages, each with independent terrain/palette
     24  8000 ????						;   * score and HUD state persist while every new room resets objectives
     25  8000 ????						;
     26  8000 ????						; Exact NTSC frame:
     27  8000 ????						;   3 VSYNC + 37 VBLANK + 192 visible + 30 overscan = 262 scanlines
     28  8000 ????						; Visible picture:
     29  8000 ????						;   16 HUD / status lines + 176 room lines
     30  8000 ????						; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
     31  8000 ????
