   1673  0829							; The Chapter One score is an eight-phrase A-minor/F/C/G composition lasting
   1674  0829							; about thirty-four seconds. Channel 0 alone performs each main note, its
   1675  0829							; silence, the lower-octave ghost, and a longer rest in sequence. Channel 1 is
   1676  0829							; silent during music and reserved exclusively for gameplay sound effects.
