   1768  08e7							; A minor, F major, C major, G major. Every pair is main then lower-octave
   1769  08e7							; ghost, followed by a completely silent position before the next statement.
   1770  08e7							; The second phrase of each chord changes note order without adding chromatic
   1771  08e7							; pitches. No two music tones can ever overlap because this is one TIA voice.
