   2073  3006							; STAGE 5 ROOM BANK
   2074  3006							;
   2075  3006							; Bank 6 owns a complete, scanline-stable room kernel and its own terrain
   2076  3006							; pages.  No bank switch occurs while the beam is drawing the room.  The
   2077  3006							; astronaut art is repeated at the same virtual addresses used by Bank 7, so
   2078  3006							; SelectPose can prepare one pointer format for both stages.
